MVC =

M → Model

V → View

C → Controller
----------------------------------------
Think:

Browser
   ↓
Controller
   ↓
Model
   ↓
View
   ↓
Browser

-------------------------------------------------
Model

Represents the data.

Example:

public class Student {

    private String name;
    private int age;

}
------------------------------------------------

View

What the user sees.

Examples:

JSP
Thymeleaf
HTML

---------------------------------------------
Controller

Receives the request and decides what should happen.

Example:

@Controller
public class StudentController {
}
